
<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="en">

<head>

<meta charset="UTF-8">

<title>CashCompass — AI Financial Report</title>

<style>

/* =====================================================
   A4 PDF OPTIMIZED
   ===================================================== */

@page {
    size: A4;
    margin: 12mm;
}

* {
    margin: 0;
    padding: 0;
    box-sizing: border-box;
}

body {
    font-family: Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif;
    background: #ffffff;
    color: #202020;
    font-size: 9px;
}

.report {
    width: 100%;
    max-width: 190mm;
    margin: auto;
    background: #ffffff;

    position: relative;
    overflow: hidden;
}

/* =====================================================
   FULL PAGE DIAGONAL WATERMARK
   ===================================================== */

.report::before {

    content: "";

    position: absolute;

    top: 50%;
    left: 50%;

    width: 420px;
    height: 420px;

    background-image: url("https://raw.githubusercontent.com/parambratamoitra/FSPImage/main/logo2.png");

    background-repeat: no-repeat;
    background-position: center;
    background-size: contain;

    opacity: 0.12;

    transform: translate(-50%, -50%) ;

    z-index: 0;

    pointer-events: none;
}


.report > * {
    position: relative;
    z-index: 1;
}
/* =====================================================
   COMPANY HEADER
   ===================================================== */

.company-header {
    display: flex;
    justify-content: space-between;
    align-items: center;
    padding-bottom: 8px;
    border-bottom: 1px solid #222;
}

.company-brand {
    display: flex;
    align-items: center;
    gap: 7px;
}

.company-logo {
    width: 50px;
    height: 50px;
    display: flex;
    align-items: center;
    justify-content: center;
    overflow: hidden;
    flex-shrink: 0;
}

.company-logo img {
    width: 50px;
    height: 50px;
    object-fit: contain;
}

.company-name {
    font-size: 25px;
    font-weight: 900;
    letter-spacing: -0.5px;
}

.company-tagline {
    margin-top: 1px;
    font-size: 14px;
    color: #777;
    font-style: italic;
}

.report-type {
    text-align: right;
}

.report-label {
    font-size: 8px;
    font-weight: 900;
    letter-spacing: 0.8px;
}

.report-period {
    margin-top: 2px;
    font-size: 6px;
    color: #999;
}


/* =====================================================
   REPORT HEADER
   ===================================================== */

.report-header {
    display: grid;
    grid-template-columns: 2fr 0.7fr;
    border-bottom: 1px solid #d8b72c;
}

.report-title {
    padding: 12px 15px 10px 0;
}

.report-title h1 {
    font-size: 27px;
    line-height: 0.95;
    font-weight: 900;
    letter-spacing: -1px;
    text-transform: uppercase;
}

.report-title h1 span {
    display: block;
    color: #d3a900;
}

.report-title p {
    margin-top: 7px;

    font-size: 8.5px;
    line-height: 1.45;
    color: black;
}

.ai-status {
    border-left: 1px solid #d8b72c;
    display: flex;
    flex-direction: column;
    align-items: center;
    justify-content: center;
    text-align: center;
}

.ai-circle {
    width: 30px;
    height: 30px;
    border-radius: 50%;
    background: #f5ca21;
    display: flex;
    align-items: center;
    justify-content: center;
    font-size: 14px;
    margin-bottom: 3px;
}

.ai-status strong {
    font-size: 12px;
    color: #d3a900;
}

.ai-status span {
    font-size: 6px;
    color: #555;
    margin-top: 1px;
}


/* =====================================================
   SUMMARY
   ===================================================== */

.summary {
    display: grid;
    grid-template-columns: 1fr 1fr 1fr;
    border-bottom: 1px solid #d8b72c;
}

.summary-box {
    min-height: 78px;
    padding: 11px 13px;
    border-right: 1px solid #e1d27b;
}

.summary-box:last-child {
    border-right: none;
}

.small-label {
    text-transform: uppercase;
    font-size: 7px;
    font-weight: 700;
    color: #777;
    letter-spacing: 0.5px;
}

.summary-number {
    font-size: 20px;
    font-weight: 800;
    margin-top: 4px;
}

.summary-number.income {
    color: #159447;
}

.summary-number.expense {
    color: #c7463d;
}

.summary-number.savings {
    color: #d2a900;
}

.summary-text {
    font-size: 7px;
    line-height: 1.4;
    color: #777;
    margin-top: 3px;
}


/* =====================================================
   MAIN CONTENT
   ===================================================== */

.main-grid {
    display: grid;
    grid-template-columns: 1.25fr 0.75fr;
    border-bottom: 1px solid #d8b72c;
}

.left-content {
    padding: 12px 15px 11px 0;
    border-right: 1px solid #d8b72c;
}

.right-content {
    padding: 12px 0 11px 15px;
}


/* =====================================================
   SECTION TITLE
   ===================================================== */

.section-title {
    display: flex;
    align-items: center;
    gap: 6px;
    margin-bottom: 6px;
}

.section-title h2 {
    font-size: 10px;
    text-transform: uppercase;
    font-weight: 850;
    letter-spacing: -0.2px;
}

.section-line {
    height: 2px;
    width: 18px;
    background: #e0bb17;
}


/* =====================================================
   TEXT
   ===================================================== */

.text-block {
    margin-bottom: 10px;
}

.text-block p {
    font-size: 9px;
    line-height: 1.5;
    

    color: #555;
    text-align: justify;
}

.highlight {
    color: #d1a700;
    font-weight: 800;
}


/* =====================================================
   BREAKDOWN
   ===================================================== */

.breakdown {
    display: grid;
    grid-template-columns: 1fr 1fr;
    gap: 7px;
    margin-top: 8px;
}

.breakdown-item {
    border-top: 1px solid #222;
    padding-top: 5px;
}

.breakdown-item h3 {
    font-size: 10px;
    text-transform: uppercase;
}

.breakdown-item p {
    font-size: 9px;
    font-weight: bold;
    color: #777;
    line-height: 1.4;
    margin-top: 2px;
}


/* =====================================================
   CHART AREA
   ===================================================== */

.chart-box {
    height: 125px;
    position: relative;
    margin-top: 3px;
    text-align: center;
}

.chart-placeholder {
    width: 100px;
    height: 100px;

    border-radius: 50%;

    margin: 8px auto;

    background:
        conic-gradient(
            #c7463d 0% var(--expense-percentage),
            #d3a900 var(--expense-percentage) 100%
        );

    position: relative;
}


/* Create the white center */

.chart-placeholder::after {

    content: "";

    position: absolute;

    width: 54px;
    height: 54px;

    background: #ffffff;

    border-radius: 50%;

    top: 23px;
    left: 23px;
}


/* Center percentage */

.chart-placeholder::before {

    content: "36%";

    position: absolute;

    z-index: 2;

    top: 42px;
    left: 0;

    width: 100%;

    text-align: center;

    font-size: 11px;

    font-weight: bold;

    color: #d3a900;
}

.chart-legend {
    text-align: center;
    font-size: 9px;
    color: #666;
    line-height: 1.6;
}

.legend-income {
    color: #c7463d;
    font-weight: bold;
}

.legend-savings {
    color: #d3a900;
    font-weight: bold;
}


/* =====================================================
   BUDGET
   ===================================================== */

.budget-section {
    border-bottom: 1px solid #d8b72c;
    padding: 11px 0;
}

.budget-grid {
    display: grid;
    grid-template-columns: 1.15fr 0.85fr;
    gap: 15px;
}

.budget-text p {
    font-size: 8.5px;
    line-height: 1.5;
    color: #555;
}

.budget-status {
    margin-top: 6px;
    display: inline-block;
    padding: 4px 7px;
    background: #f7df65;
    font-size: 7px;
    font-weight: 800;
    text-transform: uppercase;
}

.bar-container {
    height: 65px;
    position: relative;
}

.bar-title {
    font-size: 7px;
    font-weight: bold;
    margin-bottom: 4px;
}

.bar {
    height: 10px;
    width: 100%;
    background: #eeeeee;
    margin-bottom: 7px;
}

.bar-fill {
    height: 100%;
    width: 80%;
    background: #d3a900;
}

.bar-label {
    font-size: 7px;
    color: #777;
}


/* =====================================================
   AI INSIGHTS
   ===================================================== */

.ai-section {
    padding: 11px 0;
    border-bottom: 1px solid #d8b72c;
}

.ai-grid {
    display: grid;
    grid-template-columns: 1fr 1fr;
    border-top: 1px solid #ddd;
    border-left: 1px solid #ddd;
}

.ai-card {
    padding: 9px 11px;
    border-right: 1px solid #ddd;
    border-bottom: 1px solid #ddd;
    min-height: 72px;
}

.ai-card h3 {
    font-size: 10px;
    text-transform: uppercase;
    margin-bottom: 4px;
    display: flex;
    align-items: center;
    gap: 5px;
}

.ai-card p {
    font-size: 10px;
    line-height: 1.45;
    color: #666;
}

.ai-icon {
    width: 17px;
    height: 17px;
    background: #f4cd29;
    border-radius: 50%;
    display: inline-flex;
    align-items: center;
    justify-content: center;
    font-size: 8px;
}


/* =====================================================
   SAVINGS RATE
   ===================================================== */

.savings-section {
    display: grid;
    grid-template-columns: 100px 1fr;
    border-bottom: 1px solid #d8b72c;
}

.rate {
    border-right: 1px solid #d8b72c;
    padding: 10px 13px;
    display: flex;
    flex-direction: column;
    justify-content: center;
}

.rate-number {
    font-size: 27px;
    font-weight: 900;
    color: #d0a800;
}

.rate-label {
    font-size: 7px;
    text-transform: uppercase;
    font-weight: 700;
    margin-top: 2px;
}

.rate-description {
    padding: 10px 13px;
}

.rate-description h2 {
    font-size: 10px;
    margin-bottom: 4px;
    text-transform: uppercase;
}

.rate-description p {
    font-size: 9px;
    color: #666;
    line-height: 1.5;
}


/* =====================================================
   RECOMMENDATION
   ===================================================== */

.recommendation {
    padding: 10px 0;
    display: grid;
    grid-template-columns: 25px 1fr;
    gap: 8px;
}

.quote {
    font-size: 28px;
    line-height: 0.7;
    color: #e0bd20;
    font-weight: 900;
}

.recommendation p {
    font-size: 8.5px;
    line-height: 1.5;
    color: #555;
    font-style: italic;
}


/* =====================================================
   FOOTER
   ===================================================== */

.footer {
    display: flex;
    justify-content: space-between;
    align-items: center;
    border-top: 1px solid #222;
    padding-top: 7px;
}

.footer strong {
    font-size: 9px;
    text-transform: uppercase;
}

.footer span {
    font-size: 6.5px;
    color: #777;
}


/* =====================================================
   PREVENT PAGE BREAKS
   ===================================================== */

.company-header,
.report-header,
.summary,
.main-grid,
.budget-section,
.ai-section,
.savings-section,
.recommendation,
.footer {
    page-break-inside: avoid;
}


/* =====================================================
   SCREEN
   ===================================================== */

@media screen {

    body {
        background: #eeeeee;
        padding: 25px;
    }

    .report {
        background: white;
        padding: 18px 22px;
        box-shadow: 0 8px 25px rgba(0,0,0,.10);
    }
}


/* =====================================================
   MOBILE
   ===================================================== */

@media(max-width: 700px) {

    .report-header,
    .summary,
    .main-grid,
    .budget-grid,
    .savings-section {
        grid-template-columns: 1fr;
    }

    .ai-status {
        border-left: none;
        border-top: 1px solid #d8b72c;
        padding: 10px;
    }

    .summary-box {
        border-right: none;
        border-bottom: 1px solid #e1d27b;
    }

    .left-content {
        border-right: none;
        border-bottom: 1px solid #d8b72c;
        padding-right: 0;
    }

    .right-content {
        padding-left: 0;
    }

    .rate {
        border-right: none;
        border-bottom: 1px solid #d8b72c;
    }
}

</style>

</head>


<body>

<div class="report">


<!-- =====================================================
     COMPANY HEADER
===================================================== -->

<header class="company-header">

    <div class="company-brand">

        <div class="company-logo">

            <img
                src="https://raw.githubusercontent.com/parambratamoitra/FSPImage/main/logo2.png"
                alt="CashCompass Logo"
            >

        </div>

        <div class="company-info">

            <div class="company-name">
                CashCompass
            </div>

            <div class="company-tagline">
                Directing your money, daily.
            </div>

        </div>

    </div>




</header>



<!-- =====================================================
     REPORT HEADER
===================================================== -->

<div class="report-header">

    <div class="report-title">

        <h1>
            AI
            <span>Financial Report</span>
        </h1>

        <p>
            A detailed analysis of your financial activity,
            spending behaviour, savings performance and
            budget position. This report combines your
            financial data with AI-powered observations to
            provide a clearer understanding of your current
            financial health.
        </p>

    </div>


    

</div>



<!-- =====================================================
     FINANCIAL SUMMARY
===================================================== -->
<section class="summary">

    <div class="summary-box">

        <div class="small-label">
            Total Income
        </div>

        <div class="summary-number income">
            ₹{{totalIncome}}
        </div>

        <p class="summary-text">
            Total recorded income during
            the reporting period.
        </p>

    </div>


    <div class="summary-box">

        <div class="small-label">
            Total Expenses
        </div>

        <div class="summary-number expense">
            ₹{{totalExpenses}}
        </div>

        <p class="summary-text">
            Total spending across recorded
            expense transactions.
        </p>

    </div>


    <div class="summary-box">

        <div class="small-label">
            Total Savings
        </div>

        <div class="summary-number savings">
            ₹{{totalSavings}}
        </div>

        <p class="summary-text">
            Amount remaining after expenses
            are deducted from income.
        </p>

    </div>

</section>



<!-- =====================================================
     MAIN CONTENT
===================================================== -->

<div class="main-grid">


    <div class="left-content">

        <div class="section-title">

            <div class="section-line"></div>

            <h2>
                Financial Overview
            </h2>

        </div>

        <div class="text-block">

			<p>
			    Your financial activity shows a total income
			    of <strong>₹{{totalIncome}}</strong> during the reporting
			    period. From this amount,
			    <strong>₹{{totalExpenses}}</strong> was used for expenses,
			    leaving <span class="highlight">₹{{totalSavings}}</span>
			    as savings. Approximately
			    <strong>{{expensePercentage}}%</strong> of income was spent,
			    while <strong>{{savingsPercentage}}%</strong> was retained.
			</p>

        </div>


        <div class="section-title">

            <div class="section-line"></div>

            <h2>
                Spending Analysis
            </h2>

        </div>

        <div class="text-block">

			<p>
			    {{spendingAnalysis}}
			</p>

        </div>


        <div class="breakdown">

            <div class="breakdown-item">

                <h3>Income</h3>

                <p>
                    ₹{{totalIncome}} total income recorded.
                </p>

            </div>


            <div class="breakdown-item">

                <h3>Expenses</h3>

                <p>
                    ₹{{totalExpenses}} spent across transactions.
                </p>

            </div>


            <div class="breakdown-item">

                <h3>Savings</h3>

                <p>
                    ₹{{totalSavings}} remaining after expenses.
                </p>

            </div>


            <div class="breakdown-item">

                <h3>Savings Rate</h3>

                <p>
                    {{savingsPercentage}}% of total income retained.
                </p>

            </div>

        </div>

    </div>



    <!-- RIGHT CONTENT -->

    <div class="right-content">

        <div class="section-title">

            <div class="section-line"></div>

            <h2>
                Financial Distribution
            </h2>

        </div>

        <p class="summary-text">
            Relationship between spending and
            retained savings.
        </p>


        <!-- PDF SAFE CHART -->

        <div class="chart-box">

			<div
			    class="chart-placeholder"
			    style="--expense-percentage: {{expensePercentage}}%;">
			</div>

            <div class="chart-legend">

                <span class="legend-income">
                    ● Expenses {{expensePercentage}}%
                </span>

                &nbsp;&nbsp;

                <span class="legend-savings">
                    ● Savings {{savingsPercentage}}%
                </span>

            </div>

        </div>


        <div class="section-title">

            <div class="section-line"></div>

            <h2>
                Key Figure
            </h2>

        </div>


        <div style="margin-top:6px;">

            <div class="summary-number savings">
                {{savingsPercentage}}%
            </div>

            <p class="summary-text">
                of total income was successfully
                retained as savings.
            </p>

        </div>

    </div>

</div>



<!-- =====================================================
     BUDGET
===================================================== -->

<section class="budget-section">

    <div class="section-title">

        <div class="section-line"></div>

        <h2>
            Income & Budget Analysis
        </h2>

    </div>


    <div class="budget-grid">

        <div class="budget-text">

            <p>
				Total income of <strong>₹{{totalIncome}}</strong>
				provides the financial base for the period.
				The planned budget is approximately
				<strong>₹{{totalBudget}}</strong>, while actual expenses
				are <strong>₹{{totalExpenses}}</strong>.
				Spending therefore remains below budget.
            </p>

            <div class="budget-status">
                ✓ Expenses Within Budget
            </div>

        </div>


        <div class="bar-container">

            <div class="bar-title">
                Budget Utilization
            </div>

            <div class="bar">

                <div class="bar-fill"></div>

            </div>

            <div class="bar-label">
                ₹32,000 used of ₹40,000 budget — 80%
            </div>

        </div>

    </div>

</section>



<!-- =====================================================
     AI INSIGHTS
===================================================== -->

<section class="ai-section">

    <div class="section-title">

        <div class="section-line"></div>

        <h2>
            AI Insights
        </h2>

    </div>


    <div class="ai-grid">


        <div class="ai-card">

            <h3>

                <span class="ai-icon">
                    $
                </span>

                Savings Performance

            </h3>

            <p>
                Your savings rate is currently
                <strong>36%</strong>. More than one-third
                of your income remains available after
                expenses.
            </p>

        </div>


        <div class="ai-card">

            <h3>

                <span class="ai-icon">
                    ✓
                </span>

                Budget Position

            </h3>

            <p>
                Expenses of ₹32,000 are below the
                ₹40,000 budget, leaving approximately
                ₹8,000 unused.
            </p>

        </div>


        <div class="ai-card">

            <h3>

                <span class="ai-icon">
                    %
                </span>

                Spending Behaviour

            </h3>

            <p>
                Approximately 64% of income has been
                allocated to expenses. Monitoring
                discretionary spending may improve savings.
            </p>

        </div>


        <div class="ai-card">

            <h3>

                <span class="ai-icon">
                    *
                </span>

                Financial Direction

            </h3>

            <p>
                Your income currently exceeds expenses.
                Continuing to control spending can
                strengthen your financial position.
            </p>

        </div>


    </div>

</section>



<!-- =====================================================
     SAVINGS RATE
===================================================== -->

<section class="savings-section">

    <div class="rate">

        <div class="rate-number">
            36%
        </div>

        <div class="rate-label">
            Savings Rate
        </div>

    </div>


    <div class="rate-description">

        <h2>
            A Positive Saving Pattern
        </h2>

        <p>
            Your current savings rate indicates that
            ₹36 out of every ₹100 earned is retained
            after expenses. This provides a foundation
            for emergency savings, investments and
            long-term financial goals.
        </p>

    </div>

</section>



<!-- =====================================================
     RECOMMENDATION
===================================================== -->

<section class="recommendation">

    <div class="quote">
        “
    </div>

    <p>
        Your financial position currently shows a positive
        balance between income and spending. Continue
        monitoring expenses and preserve your current
        savings rate. Small improvements in spending
        behaviour can create meaningful long-term results.
    </p>

</section>



<!-- =====================================================
     FOOTER
===================================================== -->

<footer class="footer">

    <strong>
        CashCompass
    </strong>

    <span>
      
        Directing your money, daily. • AI FINANCIAL REPORT
    </span>

</footer>


</div>

</body>

</html>

